      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pikeville Cut‑Through, finished in 1987, moved 18 million cubic yards of earth and rerouted the Levisa Fork River to reduce traffic and flooding.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
